WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Chamber of Dissonant Echoes, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Lyra: Too close.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Echo Shard: Unravel.

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.200 align:center
Lyra: Get back!

6
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.500 align:center
Kael: Run... Lyra...

7
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.800 align:center
Lyra: Kael?

8
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.100 align:center
Echo Shard: Futility.

9
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.400 align:center
Lyra: Never!

10
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinthine Passageway of Shifting Memories, urgent.

11
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000 align:center
Lyra: This way!

12
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.300 align:center
Echo Shard: Lost path.

13
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.600 align:center
Lyra: Not yet.

14
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.900 align:center
Kael: The core... Light...

15
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.200 align:center
Lyra: I see it!

16
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.500 align:center
Echo Shard: Pointless struggle.

17
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.800 align:center
Lyra: Watch me.

18
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:38.100 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Nexus Chamber - Entrance, dread.

19
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.400 align:center
Lyra: Almost there.

20
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:40.700 align:center
Echo Shard: Mine.

21
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.000 align:center
Lyra: No!

22
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.300 align:center
Kael: Don't... touch...

23
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:44.600 align:center
Lyra: I have to!

24
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:45.900 align:center
Echo Shard: Give it up.

25
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.200 align:center
Lyra: Never surrender.

26
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The Nexus Chamber - Aftermath, tense.

27
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release it.

28
00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.100 align:center
Lyra: It's mine now.

29
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.400 align:center
Kael: Run. The Loom...

30
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.700 align:center
Lyra: Where?

31
00:00:57.1000 --> 00:00:58.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: No escape.

32
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.300 align:center
Lyra: Always a way.

33
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We know.

34
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.900 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of Collapsing Musical Structures, urgent.

35
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.200 align:center
Lyra: Too fast!

36
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Return what's ours.

37
00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:10.800 align:center
Kael: Hold it... tight...

38
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.100 align:center
Lyra: It's not yours!

39
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: All memory returns.

40
00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.700 align:center
Lyra: Not this one.

41
00:01:14.1000 --> 00:01:15.1000 align:center
Kael: Danger... ahead...

42
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.300 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Concert Hall of Echoing Regrets, dread.

43
00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.600 align:center
Lyra: What do you want?

44
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:24.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Order. Peace.

45
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.200 align:center
Lyra: This is destruction!

46
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.500 align:center
Kael: Don't... trust...

47
00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:28.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Reclamation.

48
00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.100 align:center
Lyra: You call this peace?

49
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Inevitability.

50
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:33.700 align:center
Lyra: Not for me.

51
00:01:34.1000 --> 00:01:38.1000 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Chamber of Fractured Reflections, tense.

52
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.300 align:center
Kael: Use it... Lyra...

53
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.600 align:center
Lyra: No! I can't.

54
00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:42.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Selfish.

55
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.200 align:center
Lyra: It's all I have left.

56
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.500 align:center
Kael: It's a weapon... now...

57
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.800 align:center
Lyra: But... it's me.

58
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release it. Be free.

59
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.400 align:center
Lyra: Free to forget?

60
00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.700 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The Apex of the Memory Spire, desperate.

61
00:01:57.1000 --> 00:01:58.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The end.

62
00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.300 align:center
Lyra: No!

63
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.600 align:center
Kael: Remember me... Lyra...

64
00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.900 align:center
Lyra: Kael! Don't go!

65
00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:04.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Join us.

66
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.500 align:center
Lyra: Never.

67
00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:06.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: What choice?

68
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.100 align:center
Lyra: This one.

69
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:13.400 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The Apex - Moment of Sacrifice, triumphant.

70
00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.700 align:center
Lyra: For us!

71
00:02:14.1000 --> 00:02:15.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Impossible!

72
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.300 align:center
Kael: Thank you... Lyra...

73
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.600 align:center
Lyra: Kael...?

74
00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:19.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Fool!

75
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.200 align:center
Lyra: I remember.

76
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Collapsing Spire - Escape, urgent.

77
00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.800 align:center
Lyra: Almost out!

78
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You gain nothing!

79
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.400 align:center
Lyra: I gained you.

80
00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.700 align:center
Lyra: Hold on.

81
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.000 align:center
Lyra: Just a little further.

82
00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:34.300 align:center
Lyra: We're leaving.

83
00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:39.600 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Void Between Memories, dread.

84
00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:40.900 align:center
Lyra: Safe... for now.

85
00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We knew.

86
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.500 align:center
Lyra: What?

87
00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:44.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You would share.

88
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.100 align:center
Lyra: How...?

89
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The next memory... awaits.

90
00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.700 align:center
Lyra: They knew.

91
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.000 align:center
Lyra: They wanted this.
